```mermaid
flowchart LR
    cfg[ambient.buffer.backend] --> sel{which?}
    sel -->|local default| fs[Local FS<br/>$XDG_STATE_HOME/ctxt/ambient/]
    sel -->|s3| s3[S3-compatible<br/>AWS / R2 / B2 / MinIO]
    sel -->|memory| mem[In-memory<br/>tests only]

    fs -->|retention| lru[LRU eviction<br/>2GB cap default]
    s3 -->|retention| lifecycle[Provider lifecycle policy]
    mem -->|retention| ring[Bounded ring]
```
